SUMMARY:Kill Tony's Pat O’Neill
LOCATION:Wiseguys - Downtown SLC\, 190 South 400 West\, Salt Lake City
DESCRIPTION:Pat O’Neill is a stand-up comedian and weekly regular on the 
 hit comedy podcast and live show Kill Tony. Originally from Massachusetts\,
  he began his comedy career in Providence\, Rhode Island\, where he was fea
 tured at the Rogue Island Comedy Festival and performed at the Comedy Conne
 ction\, including appearances as an opener for Mark Normand.\n\nNow based i
 n Austin\, Texas\, Pat has become a fixture of one of the country’s most 
 influential comedy scenes. He performs regularly at the Comedy Mothership a
 nd appears weekly on Kill Tony\, where his sharp joke-writing\, distinctive
  perspective\, and consistently strong performances have earned him The KT 
 Golden Ticket and a growing national audience. With a rapidly expanding onl
 ine following and millions of views across social media platforms\, Pat con
 tinues to establish himself as one of the most promising rising voices in s
 tand-up comedy.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/kill
 -tony-s-pat-oneill/
